	)
	(text "Terminate both bus ends only: here with the jumpers if the board is an end, on the last EPOS4 with DIP switch SW1 position 7 (120 ohm). Source: EPOS4 50/5 Hardware Reference 2023-07, section 3.3.11."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a5b2dc95-219a-5aff-8cfc-c9a0ed49e3ed")
	)
	(text "Connectors match the EPOS4 50/5 X11 / X12: Molex CLIK-Mate 4p (1 CAN_H, 2 CAN_L, 3 GND, 4 shield), so maxon's CAN-CAN cable 520858 plugs straight in. Board header 502585-0470 mates with plug 502578-0400."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e5ecc5f9-1314-5918-96ce-9f0717f7dafc")
